# TRPG Evaluator API

FastAPI service providing backend capabilities for the TRPG Evaluator MVP. See `SPEC.md` for end-to-end requirements.

## Local development

```bash
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

## Testing

```bash
pytest
```
